#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/azure.rst:90
msgid ""
"Morpheus authenticates with Azure via an App Registration with an Owner "
"or Contributor Role on a Subscription. Use the steps below to create and "
"collect the required credentials and assign the required permissions to "
"integrate Azure with |morpheus|."
msgstr "Morpheus s'authentifie auprès d'Azure via un App Registration avec un accès Owner ou Contributor à l'abonnement Azure."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/azure.rst:92
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Avertissement"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/azure/azure.rst:92
msgid ""
"Using an App Registration (service principal) that has selective resource"
" permissions and is not an Owner or Contributor of the Subscription is "
"not supported and will cause failures/issues. Please confirm the App "
"Registration you use to integrate Azure with Morpheus has Owner or "
"Contributor permissions on the specified Subscription before contacting "
"support."
msgstr "L'utilisation d'un App Registration (principal de service) disposant d'autorisations de ressources sélectives peut limiter les fonctionnalités disponibles dans |morpheus|."

